# Idle on USB with the Today board (DECISIONS.md D38): nothing touched for 15 minutes, the sleep screen comes with the
# date, the weather and the agenda, and the device stays on ("Tap to start"); a tap brings back the launcher.
# Agenda and weather as in today-board.script (ha-agenda.example.test); today is Thursday 15 January 2026, 13:34.
wait 1700               # the launcher's relay read: the agenda and the badges
tap 438 628             # Weather: the first place is read and saved
wait 1500
back
wait 902000             # 15 minutes without a touch
shot idle-board
tap 270 500
wait 1500
